hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16850","Abd Allah narrated to us, he said: Abu Khalid Hudba ibn Khalid narrated to us, he said: Hammam ibn Yahya narrated to us, he said: Abu Jamra al-Duba'i narrated to us from Abu Bakr from his father that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Whoever prays the two cool prayers will enter Paradise."
